WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.604
Welcome to Manulife Vitality Stories!

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:09.809
Once upon a time, Ed wondered how he could earn Vitality Points™.   

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:14.481
The first chapter in Ed’s story was to find out what they are.  

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:22.956
It’s simple: You can earn Vitality Points through healthy activities. And those points can turn into valuable rewards.  

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.960
What are those rewards? 
That’s what Ed found out in Chapter 2!  

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:32.332
If you reach your weekly points target through steps or workouts, 

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:37.237
you can spin the Vitality Wheel for a chance to earn gift cards from popular brands. 

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:41.708
But you can earn even more rewards by improving your Vitality Status. 

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.845
And that led Ed smoothly into Chapter 3!  

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:50.550
Status works a little differently for the two Manulife Vitality options.   

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:54.721
You can have Vitality Go at no cost with your insurance policy, 

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:59.359
which gives you valuable discounts and you can earn Vitality Wheel spins with your points.  

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.495
But Ed is a Vitality Plus member.  

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:10.036
For a few bucks a month, that means points earn spins, but also add up to more rewards when he increases his Vitality Status!  

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:14.107
Rise to Silver Status and save on insurance, 

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:19.045
and increase your discounts on many popular brands! 

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:25.151
And all those savings increase even more as you rise to Gold and Platinum Status.  

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:30.490
But now Ed was thinking: “This is amazing, but how do I get these points?” 

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:33.326
So he cracked open Chapter 4!  

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:37.197
Manulife Vitality isn’t just about workouts and steps.   

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:42.035
There are so many ways to earn Vitality Points.  
Just look at them all!

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:44.771
By the way, here’s a hot tip: 

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:49.209
make sure to open the app at least once a week, so you don’t miss out on syncing your points.  

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:52.745
Those points will be ready for you within 48 hours of earning them.   

00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:57.250
And in case you and Ed were still wondering about those steps and workouts, 

00:01:57.784 --> 00:02:00.753
you can earn up to 40 points per day for those!  

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:04.724
All that can add up to 18,000 points per year!  

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:08.128
Ed knew that meant he’d live happily ever after, 

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:12.765
with piles of points and rewards! Hopefully you can, too! 

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:16.269
Want to check out more Manulife Vitality “how-to” stories? 

00:02:16.536 --> 00:02:21.141
Click on one of the other videos you see here, then you could live happily ever after!   

